---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import FinalCta from '../components/home/FinalCta.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="How Talkera Desk Compares | Transparent Market Breakdown"
  description="Compare Talkera Desk with voicemail, human answering services, self-serve AI receptionists, and field service add-ons. Public prices, verified gaps."
  canonicalUrl="https://talkeradesk.com/compare"
>
  <div class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-light-blue border border-sky-blue text-xs font-semibold text-deep-green uppercase tracking-wider font-mono mb-4">
          Market Comparison
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-ink-deep tracking-tight mb-4">
          How Talkera Desk compares,<br />and the gap it fills.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate leading-relaxed">
          Comparing true per-minute costs, setup effort, and the decisive edge trade businesses need: an in-house engineering team that builds and manages your custom agent, not raw software or templates you have to configure alone.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 1: Direct AI Competitor Breakdown (ElevenLabs, Smith.ai, Bland AI, First Call, Voco vs Talkera Desk) -->
      <div class="mb-20">
        <div class="border border-sky-blue rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white shadow-tactile font-sans text-xs">
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-sky-blue/60">
              <thead class="bg-paper text-ink-deep font-heading font-bold">
                <tr>
                  <th class="py-4 px-4 text-left text-slate uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px] min-w-[150px]">Solution</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-3 text-left text-slate font-medium min-w-[130px]">Pricing & Per-Min</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-3 text-left text-slate font-medium min-w-[160px]">What They Provide</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-3 text-left text-slate font-medium min-w-[170px]">What Is Missing (The Gap)</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-4 text-left bg-deep-green text-lime-accent font-extrabold text-xs min-w-[200px]">
                    Talkera Desk Advantage
                  </th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 text-slate">
                <!-- Row 1: ElevenLabs -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-ink">
                    <a href="https://elevenlabs.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline text-ink flex items-center gap-1">
                      <span>ElevenLabs (DIY)</span>
                      <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px]">&nearr;</span>
                    </a>
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-400 font-normal block mt-0.5">Voice Synthesis Platform</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 font-mono">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-ink">~$0.10 to $0.30+/min</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 block">+ API & Twilio costs</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 leading-relaxed">
                    World-class voice synthesis models and raw conversational AI developer APIs.
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 leading-relaxed text-red-700">
                    Pure developer tool. Zero prompt engineering done for you. No CRM sync, no trade workflows, and no human call audits.
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 bg-light-blue/30 font-medium text-deep-green leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>Zero technical hiring:</strong> We build, test, and maintain your voice agent end-to-end. No coding or Twilio wiring required.
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Row 2: Smith.ai -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-ink">
                    <a href="https://smith.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline text-ink flex items-center gap-1">
                      <span>Smith.ai</span>
                      <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px]">&nearr;</span>
                    </a>
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-400 font-normal block mt-0.5">Hybrid AI + Human Desk</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 font-mono">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-ink">~$285 to $300+/mo</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 block">From $1.50 to $3+/call</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 leading-relaxed">
                    Human receptionist safety net backed by automated lead intake and basic CRM sync.
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 leading-relaxed text-red-700">
                    High per-call penalty fees. Script templates lack deep trade-specific triage (like water extraction urgency or HVAC diagnostic routing).
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 bg-light-blue/30 font-medium text-deep-green leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>Transparent per-minute pricing:</strong> Rates from $0.517 to $0.60/min with custom dispatch logic calibrated directly to your trades.
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Row 3: Bland AI -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-ink">
                    <a href="https://www.bland.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline text-ink flex items-center gap-1">
                      <span>Bland AI</span>
                      <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px]">&nearr;</span>
                    </a>
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-400 font-normal block mt-0.5">Developer Telephony Infrastructure</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 font-mono">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-ink">From ~$0.09 to $0.14/min</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 block">+ telephony & server setup</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 leading-relaxed">
                    High-speed conversational telephony infrastructure built for software developers.
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 leading-relaxed text-red-700">
                    Platform only. You must program the webhooks, connect your field service calendar, handle server errors, and tune latency yourself.
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 bg-light-blue/30 font-medium text-deep-green leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>Done-for-you technical team:</strong> We craft the prompt logic, manage calendar sync, monitor audio latency, and audit calls regularly.
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Row 4: First Call AI -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-ink">
                    <a href="https://firstcall-ai.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline text-ink flex items-center gap-1">
                      <span>First Call AI</span>
                      <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px]">&nearr;</span>
                    </a>
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-400 font-normal block mt-0.5">Small Business AI Answering</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 font-mono">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-ink">~$149 to $299+/mo</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 block">Tiered minute allotments</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 leading-relaxed">
                    Template-based AI receptionist software with simple onboarding forms.
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 leading-relaxed text-red-700">
                    Rigid templates. No custom prompt calibration, continuous prompt tuning, or scheduled human audits of missed or mishandled calls.
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 bg-light-blue/30 font-medium text-deep-green leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>Custom voice agent (not templates):</strong> Handcrafted rules tailored to your pricing thresholds, crew dispatch, and exact service territory.
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Row 5: Voco AI -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-ink">
                    <a href="https://vocohq.co.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline text-ink flex items-center gap-1">
                      <span>Voco AI</span>
                      <span class="text-gray-400 text-[10px]">&nearr;</span>
                    </a>
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-400 font-normal block mt-0.5">SME Voice Receptionist App</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 font-mono">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-ink">£99 to £249+/mo</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 block">Monthly recurring plans</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 leading-relaxed">
                    Self-serve answering dashboard with basic booking prompts for UK small businesses.
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 leading-relaxed text-red-700">
                    Self-serve software approach. When the bot misunderstands emergency triage or slang, there is no dedicated team reviewing the transcript.
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 bg-light-blue/30 font-medium text-deep-green leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>Full lifecycle partnership:</strong> We audit calls, review transcripts, and continuously improve prompts so your system runs without oversight.
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Row 6: Talkera Desk (Featured) -->
                <tr class="bg-deep-green/5 border-t-2 border-deep-green">
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-ink-deep bg-light-blue/40">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
                      <span class="font-heading font-extrabold text-sm text-ink-deep">Talkera Desk</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-brand-green font-bold block mt-0.5">Your In-House AI Phone Team</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 font-mono bg-light-blue/40">
                    <span class="font-bold text-deep-green text-sm">$0.517 to $0.60/min</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 block">From $59/mo PAYG or plans</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 leading-relaxed bg-light-blue/40">
                    Custom-engineered voice agent, real-time CRM & calendar booking, SMS updates to crew and callers, and scheduled call reviews.
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-3 leading-relaxed text-slate bg-light-blue/40">
                    <strong>Zero setup burden on you.</strong> You never write prompts, debug code, connect APIs, or monitor webhooks.
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4 bg-deep-green text-white font-semibold leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>An in-house team without the salary:</strong> We build your agent in up to 3 days, run it 24/7, review calls, and keep prompts tuned at no extra charge.
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2: Labor Economics & Hidden Costs (In-House vs Offshore vs Talkera Desk) -->
      <div class="mb-20">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mb-8">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-light-blue border border-sky-blue text-xs font-semibold text-deep-green uppercase tracking-wider font-mono mb-3">
            True Labor Cost Breakdown
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink-deep tracking-tight mb-2">
            In-House Staff vs. Offshore Freelancer vs. Talkera Desk
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">
            Running an efficient call-answering and CRM lead-capture desk requires looking at <em>true productive talk time</em>. An average inbound trade lead plus post-call CRM logging takes 3 to 5 minutes. Below is the honest per-minute math, baseline minimum rates, and the hidden organizational costs companies absorb.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3-Column Per-Minute Cost Cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8 font-mono text-xs">
          <!-- Card 1: In-House Employee -->
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-gray-500 tracking-wider block mb-1">Model 1: Local Employee</span>
              <h3 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-lg text-ink-deep">In-House Staff</h3>
              <p class="font-sans text-[11px] text-slate mt-1 mb-4">Based on US Federal Minimum Wage ($7.25/hr + 15% mandatory taxes/FICA = ~$8.34/hr gross).</p>
              
              <div class="space-y-2.5 py-3 border-t border-b border-sky-blue/70">
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                  <span class="text-slate font-sans">Gross Base Rate:</span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-ink tabular">$0.087 / min</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                  <span class="text-slate font-sans">Real Utilized Rate (50% Occupancy):</span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-red-700 tabular">$0.170 / min</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                  <span class="text-slate font-sans">Effective Monthly Labor:</span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-ink tabular">~$1,334 / mo</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 font-sans text-[11px] text-slate">
              <strong>The Utilization Reality:</strong> An in-house receptionist is rarely on the phone for the entire duration of an 8-hour shift. At a realistic 50% call occupancy, the effective talk-time cost spikes to $0.17 per minute.
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 2: Offshore Freelancer -->
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-gray-500 tracking-wider block mb-1">Model 2: Overseas Contractor</span>
              <h3 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-lg text-ink-deep">Offshore Freelancer</h3>
              <p class="font-sans text-[11px] text-slate mt-1 mb-4">Based on the minimum viable rate for a dependable, fluent offshore virtual receptionist ($5.00/hr in Philippines or India).</p>
              
              <div class="space-y-2.5 py-3 border-t border-b border-sky-blue/70">
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                  <span class="text-slate font-sans">Gross Base Rate:</span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-ink tabular">$0.052 / min</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                  <span class="text-slate font-sans">Real Utilized Rate (50% Occupancy):</span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-amber-700 tabular">$0.100 / min</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                  <span class="text-slate font-sans">Effective Monthly Labor:</span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-ink tabular">~$800 / mo</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 font-sans text-[11px] text-slate">
              <strong>The Utilization Reality:</strong> Independent contractors avoid payroll taxes, but nocturnal fatigue and constant turnover require ongoing recruiting, training, and supervision.
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 3: Talkera Desk -->
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-deep-green shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-deep-green text-lime-accent text-[9px] uppercase font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-bl-lg font-mono">
              Managed AI Phone Team
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-deep-green tracking-wider block mb-1">Model 3: Done-For-You AI Team</span>
              <h3 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-lg text-ink-deep">Talkera Desk</h3>
              <p class="font-sans text-[11px] text-slate mt-1 mb-4">Pay strictly for active call minutes. Zero payroll, zero idle minutes, zero shift constraints.</p>
              
              <div class="space-y-2.5 py-3 border-t border-b border-sky-blue/70">
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                  <span class="text-slate font-sans">All-Inclusive Per-Min Rate:</span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-deep-green tabular">$0.517 to $0.600 / min</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                  <span class="text-slate font-sans">Idle Time Billed:</span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-emerald-700 tabular">$0.00 (Zero)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                  <span class="text-slate font-sans">Starting Monthly Base:</span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-ink tabular">From $59 / mo</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 font-sans text-[11px] text-slate">
              <strong>The Talkera Difference:</strong> You only pay for exact productive call seconds. Multiple concurrent lines answer simultaneously 24/7 with zero management overhead.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- The Hidden Organizational Costs (The Iceberg) -->
        <div class="border border-sky-blue rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 mb-8 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-ink-deep mb-2">The Hidden "Extra" Costs That Human Labor Demands</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Beyond basic wages, businesses must absorb these recurring technical and operational expenses to execute phone answering:
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 font-sans text-xs">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue/70">
              <span class="font-bold text-ink-deep block mb-1 font-mono text-[11px]">1. VOIP Phone Licenses</span>
              <div class="text-red-700 font-mono font-bold text-xs mb-1">+$20 to $35 / user / mo</div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate leading-relaxed">System access for RingCentral, Zoom Workplace, or dialer lines for every receptionist.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue/70">
              <span class="font-bold text-ink-deep block mb-1 font-mono text-[11px]">2. CRM User Seats</span>
              <div class="text-red-700 font-mono font-bold text-xs mb-1">+$15 to $30 / user / mo</div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate leading-relaxed">User seat licenses on HubSpot, Zoho, Jobber, or ServiceTitan so staff can enter bookings.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue/70">
              <span class="font-bold text-ink-deep block mb-1 font-mono text-[11px]">3. SMS Notification Gateways</span>
              <div class="text-red-700 font-mono font-bold text-xs mb-1">API routing carrier fees</div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate leading-relaxed">Twilio or Plivo gateways ($0.0079 to $0.011/SMS in US/CA; up to $0.09 international) for dispatch texts.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue/70">
              <span class="font-bold text-ink-deep block mb-1 font-mono text-[11px]">4. Platform Taxes & FX Spreads</span>
              <div class="text-red-700 font-mono font-bold text-xs mb-1">+5% fee + 4% FX spread</div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate leading-relaxed">Upwork 5% marketplace fee, contract initiation fees ($0.99 to $14.99), and PayPal currency spreads.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Structural Pitfalls Table -->
        <div class="border border-sky-blue rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white shadow-tactile font-sans text-xs mb-6">
          <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-sky-blue/60">
            <thead class="bg-paper text-ink-deep font-heading font-bold">
              <tr>
                <th class="py-3.5 px-4 text-left font-bold text-slate uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px] w-1/4">Operational Factor</th>
                <th class="py-3.5 px-4 text-left text-slate font-medium w-1/4">In-House Local Employee</th>
                <th class="py-3.5 px-4 text-left text-slate font-medium w-1/4">Offshore Freelancer</th>
                <th class="py-3.5 px-4 text-left bg-deep-green/5 text-deep-green font-bold w-1/4">Talkera Desk AI Team</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 text-slate">
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-ink">The Scaling Ceiling</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Can only take 1 call at a time. Simultaneous callers go to voicemail and call another contractor.</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Can only take 1 call at a time. High nocturnal fatigue during US/UK business hours.</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-deep-green bg-light-blue/20">Up to 8 simultaneous calls. Zero busy signals or voicemails.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-ink">Data Security & Privacy</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Controlled on company-owned equipment under domestic jurisdiction.</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-red-600">Vulnerable: Personal home laptops, residential Wi-Fi, and lack of enterprise security controls.</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-deep-green bg-light-blue/20">Direct CRM API sync, SOC2-compliant telephony, prompt safety guardrails.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-ink">Infrastructure Reliability</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Demands physical desk, workstation, laptop, and office utility overhead.</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4">Prone to local brownouts, power cuts, and spotty residential internet connections.</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-deep-green bg-light-blue/20">Cloud carrier telephony with 24/7 carrier redundancy and failover routing.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-ink">Management Burden</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4">High HR friction, performance reviews, sick days, vacations, and payroll processing.</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-red-600">High turnover. If an independent freelancer quits abruptly, phones go dark immediately.</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-deep-green bg-light-blue/20">We build, tune, audit, and support your agent. Zero HR friction on your desk.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <!-- Cost Context & Hidden Trade-offs Disclaimer -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-xs text-amber-900 leading-relaxed font-sans">
          <strong>Cheap is not best (it comes with hidden costs and conditions):</strong> The figures above examine the <em>absolute lowest legal or viable rates possible</em> (US Federal Minimum Wage at $7.25/hr and $5.00/hr overseas freelance labor), not average or high salaries. Low hourly rates come with severe hidden costs: software licenses, payment fees, single-call bottlenecks, and management friction. More critically, a single missed $2,500 water restoration job or $6,000 HVAC replacement while a receptionist is on another call or offline erases an entire year of perceived labor savings.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Comprehensive Comparison Matrix (Spec C6) -->
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-20">
        <div class="inline-block min-w-full align-middle">
          <div class="border border-sky-blue rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white shadow-tactile">
            <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-sky-blue/60 text-xs">
              <thead class="bg-paper text-ink-deep font-heading font-bold">
                <tr>
                  <th class="py-4 px-5 text-left font-bold text-slate uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">Feature / Factor</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-4 text-left text-slate font-medium">Voicemail</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-4 text-left text-slate font-medium">Human Answering</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-4 text-left text-slate font-medium">Self-Serve AI</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-4 text-left text-slate font-medium">FSM Add-On</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-4 text-left text-slate font-medium">Enterprise AI</th>
                  <th class="py-4 px-5 text-left bg-deep-green text-lime-accent font-extrabold text-sm border-l border-r border-deep-green">
                    Talkera Desk
                  </th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 text-slate">
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-4 px-5 font-bold text-ink">Typical Public Price</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">Free</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">From ~$300/mo for low calls</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">From ~$49 to $300/mo</td>
                  <td class="py-4 px-4">~$29 to $99/mo where listed</td>
